  "vendor": "Novus",
  "model": "N1500FT",
  "vendor_website": "novus.com.br",
  "description": "Flow indicator and totalizer with 4-20 mA input, alarms, retransmission and RS485 Modbus RTU: instantaneous and total flow, alarms, linearization",
  "revision": 1,
  "revised": "2026-11-18",
  "firmware": "Protocol manual V1.0x B",
  "source": "Novus N1500FT communication protocol V1.0x B (Portuguese)",
  "sources": [
    {
      "title": "N1500FT - Protocolo de Comunicação",
      "version": "V1.0x B",
      "url": "https://cdn.novusautomation.com/downloads/protocolo_comunica%C3%A7%C3%A3o_modbus_n1500ft_v10x_b_pt.pdf",
      "note": "register table 1, status table 2",
      "accessed": "2026-11-18",
      "sha256": "1b7f8672e124efc813855144344fd5263d97de8ab85d0b239ad0c85cd9c9928e"
    }
  ],
  "notes": [
    "Modbus RTU needs the optional RS485 interface. Functions 03, 05, 06 and 16; function 05 writes the alarm relay outputs (coil 1 is relay 1) while the matching alarm is disabled.",
    "Speeds 1200 to 115200 bps, 8 data bits, 1 stop bit, no, even or odd parity. The manual does not give the factory address or baud rate: check the serial menu of the indicator.",
    "Floating-point values are IEEE-754 single precision with the high word first. The 64-bit totals are four registers, most significant first.",
    "The manual gives the range of the selection registers but not what each value means, so those registers are plain numbers.",
    "Written from the manufacturer's manual; not tested on a device."
  ],
  "protocol": "rtu",
  "unit_id": 1,
  "databits": 8,
  "stopbits": 1,
  "byte_order": "big",
  "word_order": "big",
  "address_base": 0,
  "x_status": "official",
